{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle Clash is a medieval multiplayer PVP game with 10 unique classes, each with their own abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the match starts, each player begins as the classic Knight class. From there, after every death, players either get to choose their next class, or have it assigned randomly (depends on match setting)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/gif1-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1743851613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 10 medieval classes in the game, and they each have <strong>their own unique set of skills:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Knight:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Primary: Sword Slash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secondary: Shield\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ULTIMATE: Blitz</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/knighticon.png?t=1743851613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Archer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Primary: Bow &amp; Arrow Shot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secondary: Bow Shove</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ULTIMATE: Ruthless</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/archericon.png?t=1743851613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heavy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Primary: Battleaxe Bludgeon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secondary: Dash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ULTIMATE: Rage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/heavyicon.png?t=1743851613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wizard:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Primary: Spell Cast</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secondary: Staff Shove</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ULTIMATE: Fireball</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/wizardicon.png?t=1743851613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assassin:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Primary: Dagger Stab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secondary: Double Dagger Strike</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ULTIMATE: Cloak</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/assassinicon.png?t=1743851613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swordmaster:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Primary: Katana Slash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secondary: Katana Thrust</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ULTIMATE: Barrage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/swordmastericon.png?t=1743851613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spearman:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Primary: Spear Thrust</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secondary: Spear Spin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ULTIMATE: Impale</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/spearmanicon.png?t=1743851613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arbalist:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Primary: Crossbow Bolt Shot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secondary: Crossbow Shove</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ULTIMATE: Surge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/extras/arbalisticon.png?t=1743851613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=