gif.gif?t=1743851613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And yes, if you're reading this far... the characters are naked. You're seeing that right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For bug reports, visit our Steam Discussions, and fill out the annonymous google form!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So what are you waiting for? Battle in the Clash right now!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Battle Clasher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2785480/7fa6ad117d1ef2ce192c7dbd5ede38a49a021a5e.jpg"},{"name":"Slaughterhouse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2785480/3f51da8215c924054ba407438c14781a35ab5a0f.jpg"},{"name":"Warlord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2785480/4ca1b9f63ef3dce7fbe6d922815f51f7ed09830d.jpg"},{"name":"Knightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2785480/69e12c3a878d2f29528edbd870e90ae21bafdb11.jpg"},{"name":"Untouchable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2785480/aa16046695cc8e1a1e6234c73ff9155a73426cff.jpg"},{"name":"Rampage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2785480/e72bb420a45d6e9896093beabaeea76db6d4c9fc.jpg"},{"name":"Bullseye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2785480/a0bb44b7754a289364d33320eeaff9e51a608165.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2785480?t=1743851613","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/fd30229fbca8bb16478bdc2b811e491e131cc0f3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743851613","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785480/d8adb25dbfa51881502573ca4e35ed1ebe52a637/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743851613","caps